msgid "CBUnmanned H743 Stamp"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:7
#: cf7fd71bdae44eff80fe9b5500777634
msgid "The `CBUnmanned H743 Stamp <https://cbunmanned.com/store>`_ is a flight controller loosely based on the FMUv6 standards & is designed for low volume OEMs as a drop in way to add ArduPilot to their custom hardware builds. It is a part of CBUnmanned's wider `\"Stamp\" Eco-System <https://wiki.cbunmanned.com/wiki/cbunmanned-stamp-eco-system>`_ , which brings together all the typical avionics hardware into a neat custom carrier PCB. Mounting footprints and symbols are available along with examples of basic usage on the  `Wiki <https://wiki.cbunmanned.com/wiki/cbunmanned-stamp-eco-system/h743-flight-controller>`_."
msgstr ""

